# Settings for tools/check.sh in this project. This file is yours: a sync
# never touches it. One KEY=VALUE per line; # starts a comment. Values are
# used as written (no $ expansion). A variable already set when check.sh
# starts (like one a CI workflow passes) wins over the line here.

# The boot fails the check when it uses this much memory or more, in KB.
# Default 400000 (about 390 MB). Raise it as the game grows.
# CHECK_RSS_BUDGET_KB=400000
